'''Firecracker Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Lunar New Year (Event Gacha)|Lunar New Year]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 646
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Firecracker Cat
|name2 = Macho Firecracker Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Macho Firecracker Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is pretty much just a roll on the dice. If he dodges, he can dish mediocre DPS on Red enemies, otherwise he will die. As this unit heavily relies on abilities, he doesn't work well in stages with multiple traits, but excels in pure red stages like [[Red Alert]], [[Red Passions (Insane)]], [[Citadel#Red|Red Citadel]] or even [[The March of Flames]]. This cat can be decent for [[One Horn]]s since he can dish out quick DPS to them, while also not needing to dodge often due to their low range and speed. His dodge may also allow him to be used against threatening Red enemies like [[Bore]], [[Berserkory]] and [[Professor A.]] but it is risky and overall not worth it. Additionally, due to the sheer abundance of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]], he faces a lot of competition, most notably from [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist Cat]], [[Bath Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Luxury Bath Cat]], and [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|Bellydance Cat]], who can all do at least one of his roles far better. Don't use this unit if the former options are available to you.

